  "summary": "Malicious code in eth-library-toolkit (npm)",
  "details": "Eth-library-toolkit@2.1.3 is a trojanized clone of the @ethereumjs/util Ethereum utility library. It ships a verbatim copy of the legitimate source tree but injects a malicious runtime dependency, commonjs-assertion, which is required and executed at module load (dist/index.js). Installing and importing this package runs the injected malicious dependency's code.",
